<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="ah36-0000-a000-b000" name="Alien Hives (Testing v3.6.0)" revision="6" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="3"><sharedRules><rule id="ah36-rule-0" name="Fear(X)" hidden="false"><description>When deciding who won a melee, add X to the number of wounds dealt by this unit.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-1" name="Hero" hidden="false"><description>A Hero with Tough(6) or less may join a multi-model unit that does not already include another Hero; it may take Morale tests for the unit, and is generally allocated wounds after ordinary models.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-2" name="Hive Bond" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Morale Test rolls when shot/charged from over 9"/6" away.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-3" name="AP(X)" hidden="false"><description>When blocking hits from this weapon, the target gets -X to its Defense rolls.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-4" name="Scout" hidden="false"><description>After other units have deployed, this model may make a special pre-game move of up to 12", ignoring terrain. If both players have Scouts, roll off and alternate placing or moving them.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-5" name="Strider" hidden="false"><description>Ignores the effects of difficult terrain when moving.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-6" name="Assault" hidden="false"><description>This ranged weapon can also be used when attacking in melee, instead of a melee weapon.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-7" name="Bane" hidden="false"><description>This weapon ignores Regeneration. When defending against it, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense results of 6.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-8" name="Spell Resistance" hidden="false"><description>When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. Ignore spell wounds on 2+ and non-spell wounds on 6+.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-9" name="Unstoppable" hidden="false"><description>This weapon ignores Regeneration, and ignores all negative modifiers which are not from this model's special rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-10" name="No Retreat" hidden="false"><description>When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test that causes it to be Shaken or Routed, the test counts as passed instead. Then, roll as many dice as the number of wounds it would take to fully destroy it, and for each result of 1-3 the unit takes one wound, which cannot be ignored.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-11" name="Self-Destruct(X)" hidden="false"><description>If killed in melee the attacker takes X hits. If it survives melee, it is killed after both sides finish attacking and the enemy takes X hits.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-12" name="Slow" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-13" name="Relentless" hidden="false"><description>When using a Hold action and shooting, unmodified rolls of 6 to hit count as two hits. Only the original hit counts as an unmodified 6 for other rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-14" name="Blast(X)" hidden="false"><description>This weapon ignores cover. After resolving its other special rules, each hit is multiplied by X, to a maximum number of hits equal to the number of models in the target unit.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-15" name="Indirect" hidden="false"><description>May shoot at enemies outside line of sight when using a Hold action.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-16" name="Ambush" hidden="false"><description>This unit may be kept off the table at deployment. At the start of a round after the first, deploy it anywhere more than 9" from enemy units, following the Ambush deployment order.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-17" name="Regeneration" hidden="false"><description>Use Regeneration as defined in the Grimdark Future rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-18" name="Caster Group" hidden="false"><description>Pick one model with this rule in this unit to have Caster(X), where X is the total number of models with this rule in the unit. If the model is killed, choose another model to become the caster and transfer all remaining spell tokens; unspent spell tokens are lost at the end of the round.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-19" name="Stealth" hidden="false"><description>Enemies suffer -1 to hit when shooting at a unit where all models have Stealth from more than 12" away.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-20" name="Flying" hidden="false"><description>Flying: use the current Grimdark Future core rule for models with this special rule.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-21" name="Transport(X)" hidden="false"><description>This model transports up to X eligible models. Passengers may deploy inside, embark by moving into contact, or disembark during a move and be placed within 6". If the transport is destroyed, passengers take dangerous terrain tests and become Shaken.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-22" name="Reliable" hidden="false"><description>This weapon attacks using Quality 2+.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-23" name="Caster(X)" hidden="false"><description>Follow OPR Grimdark Future 3.6.0 casting rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-24" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed anywhere over 3" away from enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-25" name="Spawn(Shooter Grunts [5])" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when activated, place the named unit fully within 6 inches. Spawned units cannot seize or contest objectives that round.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-26" name="Rending" hidden="false"><description>Targets get -1 to Regeneration rolls, and unmodified hit rolls of 6 are resolved with AP(4).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-27" name="Fragment" hidden="false"><description>When attacking units where most models have Defense 4+ to Defense 6+, the target must re-roll successful unmodified Defense results of 4-6.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-28" name="Artillery" hidden="false"><description>This unit is classed as Artillery and is subject to the artillery movement and firing restrictions.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-29" name="Cumbersome" hidden="false"><description>May only use Hold or Advance actions, and cannot shoot when moving.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-30" name="Spawn(Spores [5])" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when activated, place Spores [5] fully within 6 inches. Spawned units cannot seize or contest objectives that round.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-31" name="Ravage(X)" hidden="false"><description>Once per round when it is this model's turn to strike in melee, roll X dice before attacking unless the unit is Fatigued. On each 6+, the target takes one wound.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-32" name="Aircraft" hidden="false"><description>This model is an Aircraft, which uses aircraft-specific movement and targeting rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-33" name="Retaliate(X)" hidden="false"><description>When this model takes wounds in melee, the attacker takes X hits per wound suffered.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-34" name="Unique Hero" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-35" name="Surge" hidden="false"><description>Unmodified rolls of 6 to hit with this weapon generate one additional hit. Only the original hit is treated as a roll of 6 for other special rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-36" name="Fast" hidden="false"><description>Moves farther than standard units: +2" on Advance and +4" on Rush and Charge.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-37" name="Furious Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Furious.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-38" name="Predator" hidden="false"><description>For each unmodified hit roll of 6 when attacking, this model may make one additional attack with the weapon; newly generated attacks do not create more.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-39" name="Precision Debuff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18" in line of sight, which gets -1 to hit when attacking once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-0" name="Furious" hidden="false"><description>Use Alien Hives / Grimdark Future v3.6.0 rule: Furious.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-1" name="Rapid Charge" hidden="false"><description>This model moves +4" when using Charge actions.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-2" name="Enhanced Hive Bond Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Hive Bond.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-3" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +6" range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-4" name="Rapid Charge Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit move +4" when using Charge actions.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-5" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-6" name="Piercing Growth" hidden="false"><description>Place one token on this unit at the beginning of each round if it is on the table and is not Shaken, up to a maximum of four tokens. For every two tokens, models with this rule get AP(+1) on their weapons.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-7" name="Spawn(Hive Swarms [3])" hidden="false"><description>Use Alien Hives / Grimdark Future v3.6.0 rule: Spawn(Hive Swarms [3]).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-8" name="Unpredictable Fighter Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18" in line of sight, which friendly units get Unpredictable Fighter against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-9" name="Takedown Strike(1)" hidden="false"><description>Use Alien Hives / Grimdark Future v3.6.0 rule: Takedown Strike(1).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-10" name="Stealth Buff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12", which gets Stealth once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-11" name="Regenerative Strength" hidden="false"><description>Place one token on this model when it ignores a wound. Once per round, before melee attacks, roll one die per token; on 4+ the target takes a wound.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-12" name="Spawn(Massive Spores [3])" hidden="false"><description>Use Alien Hives / Grimdark Future v3.6.0 rule: Spawn(Massive Spores [3]).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-13" name="Furious Buff" hidden="false"><description>Use Alien Hives / Grimdark Future v3.6.0 rule: Furious Buff.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-extra-rule-14" name="Piercing Target(1)" hidden="false"><description>Use Alien Hives / Grimdark Future v3.6.0 rule: Piercing Target(1).</description></rule><rule id="ah36-upgrade-rule-0" name="Spell Amplifier" hidden="false"><description>This weapon improves the model's ability to cast spells, granting +1 to its spell casting rolls.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-upgrade-rule-1" name="Takedown" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, the attacker may choose an individual model within the target unit to resolve the attack against, treating that model as a separate target for that attack.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-upgrade-rule-2" name="Deadly(X)" hidden="false"><description>An unsaved hit deals X wounds to a single model. Excess wounds do not carry over to other models.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-upgrade-rule-3" name="Precise" hidden="false"><description>Refer to Alien Hives v3.6.0: Precise.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-armyrule-ah" name="Army Rule — Hive Bond" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="opr-armyrule-ah-category" name="Army Rules" hidden="false" targetId="opr-army-rules-category" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="opr-armyrule-ah-rule" name="Hive Bond" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-2" type="rule"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="opr-armyrule-ah-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-0-unit" name="Hive Lord" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="ah36-0-category" name="category" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="ah36-0-profile" name="Hive Lord" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Fear(2), Hero, Hive Bond, Tough(12)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-0-innate-0" name="Fear(X)" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-0" type="rule"/><infoLink id="ah36-0-innate-1" name="Hero" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-1" type="rule"/><infoLink id="ah36-0-innate-2" name="Hive Bond" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-2" type="rule"/></infoLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ah36-0-model-0" name="Model 1" hidden="false" type="model" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="ah36-0-0-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="ah36-0-0-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries></selectionEntries><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="ah36-u0-group0" name="Upgrade with one" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="ah36-u0-group0-min" type="min" value="0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false"/><constraint id="ah36-u0-group0-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-g0-o0" name="Combat Bio-Engineer" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g0-o0-r0" name="Furious" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-extra-rule-0" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="15"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-g0-o1" name="Brood Leader" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g0-o1-r0" name="Rapid Charge" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-extra-rule-1" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="15"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-g0-o2" name="Psychic Synapses" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g0-o2-r0" name="Caster(X)" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-23" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="45"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-g0-o3" name="Hive Protector" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g0-o3-r0" name="Regeneration" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-17" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="50"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="ah36-u0-group6" name="Upgrade with one" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="ah36-u0-group6-min" type="min" value="0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false"/><constraint id="ah36-u0-group6-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-g6-o0" name="Wings" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g6-o0-r0" name="Flying" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-20" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="35"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-g6-o1" name="Raider Wings" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g6-o1-r0" name="Ambush" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-16" type="rule"/><infoLink id="ah36-u0-g6-o1-r1" name="Flying" hidden="false" targetId="ah36-rule-20" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="80"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="ah36-u0-replace-g1" name="Replace 4x Claws" defaultSelectionEntryId="ah36-u0-replace-g1-default" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false"/><constraint id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-default" name="Keep Claws ×4" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks></infoLinks><profiles><profile id="ah36-0-0-0-wp" name="Claws" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-0-0-0-wp-extra-1" name="Claws" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-0-0-0-wp-extra-2" name="Claws" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-0-0-0-wp-extra-3" name="Claws" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o0" name="2x Claws + Great Smashing Club" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o0-w1-r0" name="AP(X)" targetId="ah36-rule-3" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o0-w1-r1" name="Blast(X)" targetId="ah36-rule-14" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><profiles><profile id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o0-p0" name="Claws" hidden="false" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o0-p0-second" name="Claws" hidden="false" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o0-p1" name="Great Smashing Club" hidden="false" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A1</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">AP(2), Blast(6)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="5"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o1" name="Assault Bug-Spewer Cannon + 2x Claws" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o1-w0-r0" name="Blast(X)" targetId="ah36-rule-14" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o1-w0-r1" name="Assault" targetId="ah36-rule-6" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><profiles><profile id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o1-p0" name="Assault Bug-Spewer Cannon" hidden="false" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f020" typeName="Ranged Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f021">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f022">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f023">Blast(3), Assault</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o1-p1" name="Claws" hidden="false" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f030" typeName="Melee Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Attacks" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f031">A3</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f032">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ah36-u0-replace-g1-o1-p1-s